# Allowlist. Everything is excluded unless re-included below, so a local file (an
# .env with LAN addresses or test credentials, a log, a coverage report) can never
# reach the build and be baked into a bundle.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps
!packages
!docker

# Never, even inside an allowed directory
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
